        "popupInfo": {
          "title": "{expression/title}",
          "expressionInfos": [
            {
              "name": "pct",
              "title": "Canopy cover",
              "returnType": "string",
              "expression": "return Text($feature.CANOPY_PCT, '#0.0') + '%';"
            },
            {
              "name": "bounds",
              "title": "Bounds",
              "returnType": "string",
              "expression": "return Text($feature.CANOPY_LOW_PCT, '#0.0') + '% to ' + Text($feature.CANOPY_HIGH_PCT, '#0.0') + '%';"
            },
            {
              "name": "change",
              "title": "Against October 19",
              "returnType": "string",
              "expression": "var d = $feature.CANOPY_PCT - $feature.CANOPY_PCT_OCT19;\nif (Abs(d) < 0.005) { return 'The same as'; }\nreturn Text(Abs(d), '0.00') + ' points ' + IIf(d < 0, 'below', 'above');"
            },
            {
              "name": "title",
              "title": "Zone",
              "returnType": "string",
              "expression": "var n = $feature.ZONE_NAME;\nreturn IIf(Left($feature.ZONE_ID, 7) == 'PUBLIC:', 'Public owner: ' + n, n);"
            }
          ],
          "popupElements": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p><b>Canopy cover {expression/pct}</b> of the area the lidar observed (bounds {expression/bounds}).</p><p>About {CANOPY_ACRES} acres of tree canopy in {ZONE_ACRES} acres. The whole city: 25.59%.</p><p>{expression/change} the October 19 estimate of {CANOPY_PCT_OCT19}%, which came from the earlier classification; the October 22 figure above is the current one.</p><p>The lidar observed {OBSERVED_PCT}% of the zone; the bounds count the unobserved part as no canopy or as all canopy. Canopy is vegetation at least 2 m tall.</p><p style='font-size:11px;color:#6b6b6b'>Unvalidated lidar planning estimate (2023 Salt Lake Valley QL1 lidar); not surveyed or field-verified.</p>"
